    "notes": "Svendborg rules a scattered sea of islands south of Funen: Tåsinge, Thurø, Langeland and a dozen more, with vassals as far as Nakskov and Als. Our people are sailors, our council is free and open, and our wealth comes from the water. The archipelago must become one maritime power.",
